@MiniMes_HostAddress = http://localhost:5033

# Preencha com os ids que os POSTs de criação devolvem (201).
@productId = 44068a15-4e73-48f5-b497-0992402a8623
@orderId = 2d01d137-ed33-448a-baed-beb30041548b
@secondOrderId = 49ba99ab-b394-45d4-a465-a2655941868f

### Health check
GET {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/health

##############################################################################
# Products — rode este bloco primeiro: a ordem precisa de um produto ativo.
##############################################################################

### Criar um produto (nasce ativo) → 201, copie o "id" para @productId
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "P-0001",
  "name": "Eixo de transmissão"
}

### Criar o mesmo código de novo → 422 (código duplicado)
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "P-0001",
  "name": "Eixo de transmissão (duplicado)"
}

### Listar produtos
GET {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Obter um produto
GET {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Accept: application/json

### Obter produto inexistente → 404
GET {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/products/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

### Desativar → 204 (produto inativo não pode entrar em ordem nova)
PATCH {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}/deactivate

### Reativar → 204
PATCH {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}/activate

##############################################################################
# Production orders — ciclo Draft → Released → InProgress → Completed
##############################################################################

### Criar uma ordem (nasce em Draft) → 201, copie o "id" para @orderId
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "OP-0001",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "plannedQuantity": 100,
  "priority": 1
}

### Criar o mesmo orderNumber de novo → 422 (número duplicado)
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "OP-0001",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "plannedQuantity": 50,
  "priority": 1
}

### Criar com produto inexistente → 404
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "OP-9999",
  "productId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "plannedQuantity": 10,
  "priority": 1
}

### Criar com produto desativado → 422 (rode o /deactivate acima antes)
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "OP-9998",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "plannedQuantity": 10,
  "priority": 1
}

### Listar ordens
GET {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders
Accept: application/json

### Obter uma ordem
GET {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json

### Liberar (Draft → Released) → 204, preenche releasedAt
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders/{{orderId}}/release

### Liberar de novo → 422 (só ordem em Draft pode ser liberada)
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders/{{orderId}}/release

### Iniciar (Released → InProgress) → 204
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders/{{orderId}}/start

### Concluir (InProgress → Completed) → 204
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders/{{orderId}}/complete

### Cancelar a ordem concluída → 422 (só Draft ou Released podem ser canceladas)
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders/{{orderId}}/cancel

### Transição em ordem inexistente → 404
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/release

### Segunda ordem, só para cancelar ainda em Draft → 201, copie para @secondOrderId
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "OP-0002",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "plannedQuantity": 25,
  "priority": 2
}

### Cancelar (Draft → Cancelled) → 204
POST {{MiniMes_HostAddress}}/api/production-orders/{{secondOrderId}}/cancel

###
